* CMOS inverter, unloaded transient
* Rebuilt from the circuit described in the README (original LTspice schematic was not in the repo).
* VDD=5 V, NMOS 10u/10u, PMOS 20u/10u, PULSE and .tran as documented.

.include ../models/inverter_models.lib

VDD vdd 0 5
VIN in 0 PULSE(0 5 2m 1n 1n 5m 10m)

M1 out in 0 0 NM L=10u W=10u
M2 out in vdd vdd PM L=10u W=20u

.tran 20m
.end
